            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Sai Gon Ut Thang",
            "review_text": "Maureen F\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat find in Da Nang\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nMy husband and I ate at this neat little spot in Da Nang twice. Great BBQ pork chops and ribs……..that were delicious. Very clean and well priced. Run by a lovey, young wife and husband. The husband also provides driving services, we used him to take us from Hoi An to Da Nang. He was a good, safe driver..\nWe would highly recommend their restaurant and driving services. \nFebruary 2025 from Ottawa, Canada.\nRead more\nWritten February 28, 2025",
